          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Choosing the right country depends on your academic goals, budget, and post-study work opportunities. You should research countries known for excelling in your specific field, such as Germany for engineering or the UK for business, while also considering living costs and visa rules."
          }
        },
        {
          "@@type": "Question",
          "name": "Which countries offer affordable study abroad options?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@@type": "Answer",
